# Tab from a `tabindex=0` box with no handler goes on in tree order, past the
# plain box and the `-1` one, to the button; then on past the bound `-1`.
key zero Tab
key reveal Tab
# A click focuses `-1`; its own `key` handler hears the key first.
tap minus
key minus a
# Once revealed, the bound box joins the order after the button.
tap reveal
key reveal Tab
key bound Shift+Tab
